1157
01:52:27,458 --> 01:52:32,499
Dia mengenakan bros di jaket biru.

1158
01:52:32,500 --> 01:52:34,707
Jadi saya berkata padanya,

1159
01:52:34,708 --> 01:52:39,292
"Tidak, Aurora, dengan bros di jaketmu, kau terlihat terlalu feminin."

1160
01:52:40,833 --> 01:52:44,707
Dan dia, terkejut,

1161
01:52:44,708 --> 01:52:46,833
